<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PAXAR started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PAXAR started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Boston analyst Lloyd Widom said he initiated coverage of PAXAR Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said set a 12-month price target of $24.</p>
<p>-- said set earnings estimates of $1.00 per share for calendar year 1997, and $1.30 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- PAXAR gained 3/8 to 18-3/4 in morning trading.</p>
